<title>USA: American Radio extends exchange offer.</title>
<headline>American Radio extends exchange offer.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Radio Systems Corp said it has extended its offer to exchange all outstanding shares of its 11-3/8 percent Cumulative Exchangeable Preferred Stock, Series A.</p>
<p>The exchange, for shares of 11-3/8 percent Cumulative Exchangeable Preferred Stock, Series B, has been extended until 1700 EDT today.</p>
<p>American Radio owns and/or programs and markets about 100 radio stations.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
